g IP protected training images, \\u003cstrong\\u003eto what degree are users protected\\u003c/strong\\u003e in the case of gens that are inadvertently infringing based simply on the associations that are made from their prompts that do not contain specific branded or otherwise protected terminology?\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/aside\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThere should be some indemnity that Roblox provides to developers for cases such as this.  Each generated asset should contain the terms that was used to generate it, either by metadata attached to the asset or encoded into the asset itself using steganography.  This way, Roblox can verify what terms were used to generate the asset.  Of course, if using the latter, if the asset is modified in any way, the encoding will be destroyed.  This could be used as an indicator of an AI generated asset, a modified asset, or something uniquely created.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eYour questions are some that Roblox needs to answer.\\u003c/p\\u003e\&quot;,\&quot;post_number\&quot;:10,\&quot;post_type\&quot;:1,\&quot;posts_count\&quot;:52,\&quot;updated_at\&quot;:\&quot;2024-03-20T13:12:23.212Z\&quot;,\&quot;reply_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;reply_to_post_number\&quot;:5,\&quot;quote_count\&quot;:1,\&quot;incoming_link_count\&quot;:10,\&quot;reads\&quot;:785,\&quot;readers_count\&quot;:784,\&quot;score\&quot;:237.0,\&quot;yours\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_id\&quot;:2881851,\&quot;topic_slug\&quot;:\&quot;protecting-intellectual-property-when-using-generative-ai\&quot;,\&quot;display_username\&quot;:\&quot;Maelstorm_1973\&quot;,\&quot;primary_group_name\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_name\&quot;:\&quot;Programmers\&quot;,\&quot;flair_url\&quot;:\&quot;scroll\&quot;,\&quot;flair_bg_color\&quot;:\&quot;0043FF\&quot;,\&quot;flair_color\&quot;:\&quot;fff\&quot;,\&quot;flair_group_id\&quot;:54,\&quot;badges_granted\&quot;:[],\&quot;version\&quot;:1,\&quot;can_edit\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_delete\&quot;:false,\&quot;c