4\\\&quot; src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/rosariadev/60/8924836_2.png\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;avatar\\\&quot;\\u003e Rosaria_UGC:\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eNo. This is tech heresy, honestly. AI only takes jobs from other creators, this is not helping anyone except the lazy people who refuse to learn the skills that myself and many other devs have put years of work into. I didnt put 5 years of work into my skills just to be replaced by a texture generator because people who lack the skill or cant afford to pay others to make a game don’t want to put in the same effort I did.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eNot to mention, AI is built off the backs of artists like myself who have had their textures and work unfairly fed into an AI\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/aside\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eWelcome to late stage capitalism. Corpos will replace you with software using your work without consent and any laws on this matter will rarely help small artists, as we’ve seen in the past.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003caside class=\\\&quot;quote no-group\\\&quot; data-username=\\\&quot;RosariaDev\\\&quot; data-post=\\\&quot;13\\\&quot; data-topic=\\\&quot;2881851\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;title\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;quote-controls\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003cimg alt=\\\&quot;\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;24\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;24\\\&quot; src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/rosariadev/60/8924836_2.png\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;avatar\\\&quot;\\u003e Rosaria_UGC:\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eso it can rip our works and frankenstein them together to create something “new”.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/aside\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThis is a reactionary take that relies on not understanding how these models work. Your (completely valid) position is better off without this.\\u003c/p\\u003e\&quot;,\&quot;post_number\&quot;:18,\&quot;post_type\&quot;:1,\&quot;posts_count\&quot;:52,\&quot;updated_at\&quot;:\&quot;2024-03-20T19:35:53.548Z\&quot;,\&quot;reply_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;reply_to_post_number\&quot;:13,\&quot;quote_count\&quot;:1,\&quot;incoming_link_count\&quot;:5,\&quot;reads\&quot;:473,\&quot;readers_count\&quot;:472,\&quot;score\&quot;:164.6,\&quot;yours\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_id\&quot;:2881851,\&quot;topic_slug\&quot;:\&quot;protecting-intellectual-property-when-using-generative-ai\&quot;,\&quot;display_username\&quot;:\&quot;sparker22\&quot;,\&quot;primary_group_name\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_name\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_url\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_bg_color\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_color\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_group_id\&quot;:null,\&quot;badges_granted\&quot;:[],\&quot;version\&quot;:1,\&quot;can_edit\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_delete\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_recover\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_see_hidden_post\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_wiki\&quot;:false,\&quot;read\&quot;:true,\&quot;user_title\&quot;:\&quot;Programmer\&quot;,\&quot;title_is_group\&quot;:false,\&quot;reply_to_user\&quot;:{\&quot;username\&quot;:\&quot;RosariaDev\&quot;,\&quot;name\&quot;:\&quot;Rosaria_UGC\&quot;,\&quot;avatar_template\&quot;:\&quot;/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/rosariadev/{size}/8924836_2.png\&quot;},\&quot;bookmarked\&quot;:false,\&quot;actions_summary\&quot;:[{\&quot;id\&quot;:2,\&quot;count\&quot;:3}],\&quot;moderator\&quot;:false,\&quot;admin\&quot;:false,\&quot;staff\&quot;:false,\&quot;user_id\&quot;:248,\&quot;hidden\&quot;:false,\&quot;trust_level\&quot;:1,\&quot;deleted_at\&quot;:null,\&quot;user_deleted\&quot;:false,\&quot;edit_reason\&quot;:null,\&quot;can_view_edit_history\&quot;:false,\&quot;wiki\&quot;:false,\&quot;post_url\&quot;:\&quot;/t/protecting-intellectual-property-when-using-generative-ai/2881851/18\&quot;,\&quot;can_accept_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_unaccept_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;accepted_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_accepted_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_translate\&quot;:false,\&quot;is_translated\&quot;:false,\&quot;detected_language\&quot;:null},{\&quot;id\&quot;:10506638,\&quot;name\&quot;:\&quot;MacJoePlays\&quot;,\&quot;username\&quot;:\&quot;MacJoePlays\&quot;,\&quot;avatar_template\&quot;:\&quot;/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/macjoeplays/{size}/9083553_2.png\&quot;,\&quot;created_at\&quot;:\&quot;2024-03-20T19:53:16.024Z\&quot;,\&quot;cooked\&quot;:\&quot;\\u003cp\\u003eRoblox encourages everyone to take legal action involving our works and if you believe that your works are copied by others, then we encourage you to take a DMCA report to remove such copyrighted items of your works.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eRoblox also said \\\&quot; \\u003cstrong\\u003eThis lava would not be protectable because AI is solely generating it. In other words, you can’t submit a DMCA takedown notice if someone used the same lava pattern in their experience. Additionally, someone who generated a similar material in their experience, wouldn’t be able to claim that you were copying their work.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\\&quot;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eAdditionally, the more unique stuff you put into your works the more it will protect your own works.\\u003c/p\\u003e\&quot;,\&quot;post_number\&quot;:19,\&quot;post_type\&quot;:1,\&quot;posts_count\&quot;:52,\&quot;updated_at\&quot;:\&quot;2024-03-20T19:54:21.704Z\&quot;,\&quot;reply_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;reply_to_post_number\&quot;:14,\&quot;quote_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;incoming_link_count\&quot;:5,\&quot;reads\&quot;:439,\&quot;readers_count\&quot;:438,\&quot;score\&quot;:112.8,\&quot;yours\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_id\&quot;:2881851,\&quot;topic_slug\&quot;:\&quot;protecting-intellectual-property-when-using-generative-ai\&quot;,\&quot;display_username\&quot;:\&quot;MacJoePlays\&quot;,\&quot;primary_group_name\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_name\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_url\&qu