<h3><a href="https://www.makeuseof.com/can-you-copyright-photograph-of-ai-art/" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow ugc">Can You Copyright a Photograph of Your AI Art?</a></h3>

  <p>You can't copyright AI art created solely from a text prompt. But what about a photo of it?</p>


  </article>

  <div class="onebox-metadata">
    
    
  </div>

  <div style="clear: both"></div>
